<p>Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-3%, 16%, 26%, 32%, 36%</acronym> chance get a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, fully disrupting it (including extra blows from certain talents), dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">62%, 71%, 78%, 84%, 90%</acronym> archery damage, and knocking the attacker back <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> tiles.</p><p>Activating this talent will not interrupt reloading.</p>